SUMMARY:Paper Mache Alebrijes sculpture drop-in studio
DESCRIPTION:Create a fantastical paper mache alebrijes sculpture over a series of 6 drop-in sessions on Wednesday evenings starting September 9\, 2026. Workshop will be led by Ana Gabriela Lopez Castro of AGLCreative Studio. Creations will take at least 4 of the 6 sessions to complete. \nNo registration is required but space for each studio session is limited. This program is most suitable for adults\, teens\, and families with children aged 8 and up. All participants 12 years of age and under must be accompanied by an adult. For more information\, please contact Main Street branch at (416)393-7700
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/paper-mache-alebrijes-sculpture-drop-in-studio-2/
LOCATION:Main Street Library\, 137 Main Street\, Toronto\, M4E 2V9
END:VEVENT
