SUMMARY:Silent Movie Magic
DESCRIPTION:Step back into the golden age of cinema for a truly unique live experience. Watch two silent film masterpieces featuring the incomparable Charlie Chaplin and Toronto-born screen legend Mary Pickford\, projected on our giant 14-foot screen. \nWhat makes the evening special is the live improvised piano score performed by acclaimed pianist Bruce Vogt. Just as audiences experienced these films a century ago\, every gesture\, laugh\, chase\, and dramatic twist comes alive through music created in the moment. \nComplete with complimentary popcorn\, this unforgettable evening captures the charm\, laughter\, and wonder of the silent movie era.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/silent-movie-magic/
LOCATION:Kingston Road United Church\, 975 Kingston Rd
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28140844/edit-silent-movie.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Kingston Road Village Concert Series":MAILTO:kruc.info@gmail.com
