SUMMARY:Wonder Church
DESCRIPTION:St. Aidan’s Anglican Church is excited to offer a service designed for babies\, toddlers\, preschoolers\, early elementary children and their families called Wonder Church. This is a 30-45 minute service that includes puppets\, music\, and prayers. Coffee and treats are provided. All are welcome. For more information\, contact children’s minister Elizabeth at children@staidansinthebeach.com.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/wonder-church-11/
